%% TO-BE propose - machine a etats unifiee
%% 1) une seule fabrique de transition (assertCareStageTransition partout)
%% 2) status legacy derive de care_stage (legacyStatusFromCareStage) ou supprime
%% 3) contrainte/trigger DB de coherence care_stage <-> status <-> outcome
%% 4) transitions tracees dans visit_events avec from/to
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> triage_pending: enregistrement
    triage_pending --> waiting_care: triage valide (ou delai depasse)
    triage_pending --> in_care: critical
    triage_pending --> completed: parti avant vue

    waiting_care --> in_care: placement + debut
    waiting_care --> disposition_pending: decision sans passage en salle
    waiting_care --> completed: parti avant vue

    in_care --> in_observation: mise en observation
    in_care --> disposition_pending: decision d'issue
    in_care --> waiting_care: retour en attente

    in_observation --> in_care: reprise de soins
    in_observation --> disposition_pending: decision d'issue

    disposition_pending --> completed: clôture confirmee
    disposition_pending --> in_care: correction de decision

    completed --> [*]

    note right of triage_pending
        Toute transition passe par:
        careService.transition(visit, to, actor)
        -> verifie la matrice
        -> ecrit status derive + visit_events
        -> publie l'evenement SSE
        Aucun service ne peut ecrire care_stage directement.
    end note
